OL,3,GNEWSAThousands without power amid Storm
OL,4,ABoelo winds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of properties across the
OL,7,Fsouth east of England have experienced
OL,8,Fpower cuts following Storm Boelo.
OL,10,FThe UK's second named storm of the
OL,11,Fseason, coming just one day after Storm
OL,12,FAusten, brought heavy rain and powerful
OL,13,Fwinds uprooted trees, blocking roads
OL,14,Fand damaging power cables.
OL,16,FAmong those affected by power supply
OL,17,Fissues were 550 properties in Battle
OL,18,Fand 480 in Heathfield, both in East
OL,19,FSussex, plus 450 in Hamstreet, Kent,
OL,20,Faccording to the UK Power Networks
OL,21,F(UKPN) website.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
