OL,3,GNEWSAThousands without power amid Storm
OL,4,ABoelo winds
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement earlier, UKPN said there
OL,7,Fwere "a number of localised power cuts
OL,8,Faffecting customers across parts of
OL,9,FSurrey, Kent and Sussex" and its teams
OL,10,Fwere working to restore supplies.
